            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.3.23+DEU.3.24+DEU.3.25+DEU.3.26+DEU.3.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 3:23–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku iyo-iyo, Mwenyezi Mlungu achimuambira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kaambuke mwango Nebo urio kahi za myango ya Abarimu kpwenye tsi ya Moabu, kuelekeya mudzi wa Jeriko, ulole tsi ya Kanani ninayoapha Aiziraeli airisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko hiko dzulu ya mwango undafwa na kukutana na akareo dza vira mwenenu Aruni arivyofwa katika mwango Hori na kukutana nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hino ni kpwa sababu mwimwi mosi airi mwavundza uaminifu wenu kpwangu mbere za Aiziraeli mriphokala kpwenye madzi ga Meriba, phephi na mudzi wa Kadeshi, ko jangbwa ra Sini. Mchikosa kuonyesa utakatifu wangu kahi ya Aiziraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Undaona tsi iriyo mberezo, ela kundainjira kpwenye tsi iyo ninayoapha Aiziraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
